{"id":"suficiente","lemma":"suficiente","pos":"adj","rank":284,"glosses":["sufficient, enough"],"ipa":"/sufiˈθjente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"suficientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-suficiente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esto no es suficiente.","en":"It isn't enough.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534824"},{"text":"¿Mil yenes son suficientes?","en":"Is a thousand yen enough?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585827"},{"text":"Eso no es suficiente.","en":"That isn't enough.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444430"},{"text":"¿Tenemos suficientes cubiertos para treinta personas?","en":"Do we have enough silverware for thirty people?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459157"},{"text":"Ya es suficiente, chicos.","en":"Knock it off, guys.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448466"}]}